  ['“After 18 Months, We’ve Got A 49% Increase In Leads. I’d Never Go Back To Not Using Dead River.”', 'Beth Hourigan, Director, Aged Care Financial Services'],
  ['“From $3 Million To $50 Million In 12 Months With Dead River”', 'Dylan Trickey, Marketing Coordinator'],
  ['“The goal was to get 8 sales in the first year. It’s been 11 months now and we’ve had 23 sales. Which is $7 million in revenue. The money I spent with Dead River I’ve seen a return on investment of five to six times.”', 'Lee Selkrig, Founder, Enso Homes'],
  ['“We\'ve Doubled In Staff Numbers”', 'Selma Christofi, Original UGG Australia Classic'],
  ['“We\'ve Increased Our Revenue By 50 Percent”', 'Adam Hurdley, Managing Director, Hurdleys Office Furniture'],
  ['“From 3 Weeks Of Jobs To 6 Months Booked In Advance”', 'Tye Spierings, Owner & Director, Ultimate Windows'],
  ['“Generated 95 to 100 Closed Jobs”', 'Rohan Fisher, Director, Fisher Roofing'],
